<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 23.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 23.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesdsay.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.43     1.62</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42     2.40</p>
<p> 3   Natl Consol	    10.11     0.89</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.49     0.79</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.09     1.07</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.85     1.14</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   8.63     1.89</p>
<p> 8   Davids Limited	  8.47     1.18</p>
<p> 9   Sea World Prop	  8.38     1.42</p>
<p>10   Indu Property	   8.32     1.02</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.26     2.33</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 8.02     1.33</p>
<p>13   Central Norseman	8.00     0.50</p>
<p>14   Equitilink		7.94     0.63</p>
